From e35471d8ec11e0294f78359bd9bcd9fba30f4df7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?St=C3=A9phane=20Graber?= <stgraber@stgraber.org>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 20:09:06 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] incusd: Only send the snapshots the source offered
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

A migration target could name snapshots the source never offered, both
on a refresh and for dependent volumes, and the names were used as path
components on the source.

Keep only the requested names that match the source's own snapshots.

This addresses GHSA-42x8-664j-84w8 (CVE pending)

Signed-off-by: Stéphane Graber <stgraber@stgraber.org>
(cherry picked from commit 7652795ee69b018b4406bbfc2643c1bf12117a96)
---
 cmd/incusd/migrate_storage_volumes.go           |  2 +-
 internal/server/instance/drivers/driver_lxc.go  |  2 +-
 internal/server/instance/drivers/driver_qemu.go |  2 +-
 internal/server/migration/migration_volumes.go  | 12 ++++++++++++
 internal/server/storage/backend.go              | 10 ++++++++++
 5 files changed, 25 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/cmd/incusd/migrate_storage_volumes.go b/cmd/incusd/migrate_storage_volumes.go
